{"unit_id": "zhangzujian__dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop#card-zh", "repo": "zhangzujian/dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop", "commit": "d6f43662a5f8dbe3bbbc36a443fab29a4cbbb22a", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop 是面向 DSH 的兼容插件，在工具运行时处理重复或更窄的沙箱权限请求。它包装工具执行和 Agent Loop 调度器准备入口；对 bash、pwsh、write、edit，在请求权限不高于会话有效权限时移除 sandbox_permissions 与 justification，再交给原运行时。更高权限、未知权限或格式不完整的请求保持原样。适合使用 DSH 0.1.0-rc.6、遇到同级权限请求被拒绝的用户。需 Node.js 22 及 DSH 环境，不需要额外密钥。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.mjs:45-93"]}
{"unit_id": "zhangzujian__dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop#card-en", "repo": "zhangzujian/dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop", "commit": "d6f43662a5f8dbe3bbbc36a443fab29a4cbbb22a", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop is a DSH plugin for redundant sandbox permissions. It wraps tool execution and scheduler preparation, removing permission fields for non-escalating bash, pwsh, write, and edit calls. Wider or malformed requests pass unchanged. For DSH rc.6; requires Node.js 22.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.mjs:45-93"]}
